@startuml talk2api2_project_map
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

left to right direction

title talk2api2 - Project Map

actor "Client / FE" as Client

rectangle "FastAPI App\napp/main.py" as App {
  package "API Layer\napp/api" as API {
    [dependencies.py\nTenantContext + HMAC verify] as Dep
    [endpoints.py\nprocess-input/audio/search/rag/chats] as Endpoints
    [models.py\nPydantic request/response] as ApiModels
  }

  package "Engine Layer\napp/engine" as Engine {
    [agent.py\nLLM loop + <tool_call>/<answer>] as Agent
    [tools.py\ncrm_action/rag_search/my_meetings/crm_query] as Tools
    [quick_actions.py\nregex shortcut path] as Quick
    [pending_patch.py\npatch pending_action from follow-up input] as PendingPatch
    [adjustments.py\nmodule/date/entity normalization] as Adjustments
    [rag.py\nTenantRAGService + embedding + Qdrant] as RagEngine
  }

  package "Domain + NLU\napp/domain + app/nlu" as Domain {
    [entity_resolver.py] as EntityResolver
    [temporal_resolver.py] as TemporalResolver
    [contracts.py\npending_action envelope] as Contracts
    [command_parser.py\nquick action parser] as Parser
  }

  package "Services\napp/services" as Services {
    [tenant_manager.py\ncredentials + tenant access] as TenantMgr
    [crm_client.py\nCoripo/Sugar API client] as CrmClient
    [crm_write_service.py\nconfirmation + mutations] as WriteSvc
    [crm_read_service.py\nstructured read/search] as ReadSvc
  }

  package "Core\napp/core" as Core {
    [config.py\nsettings/env] as Config
    [security.py\nHMAC + tenant secret crypto] as Security
    [audio.py\nWhisper STT + edge-tts] as Audio
    [logging.py] as Logging
  }

  package "Persistence\ndatabase" as DBLayer {
    [session.py\nasync engine + init_db] as DbSession
    [models.py\nTenant/Chat/ChatMessage] as DbModels
  }
}

database "PostgreSQL / SQLite" as SQLDB
cloud "SugarCRM / Coripo REST API" as CRM
database "Qdrant\n(tenant collections)" as Qdrant
cloud "LLM endpoint\n(OpenAI-compatible)" as LLM

Client --> App : HTTP (X-Tenant, X-User-Id)\n/process-input, /process-audio, /search
Dep --> Security
Dep --> TenantMgr
TenantMgr --> DbSession
DbSession --> SQLDB
DbModels --> SQLDB

Endpoints --> Quick
Quick --> Parser
Quick --> WriteSvc

Endpoints --> PendingPatch
Endpoints --> Agent
Agent --> Tools
Agent --> LLM

Tools --> WriteSvc
Tools --> ReadSvc
Tools --> CrmClient
Tools --> RagEngine

WriteSvc --> Adjustments
Adjustments --> EntityResolver
Adjustments --> TemporalResolver
WriteSvc --> CrmClient
WriteSvc --> RagEngine
ReadSvc --> CrmClient
ReadSvc --> RagEngine
RagEngine --> Qdrant
CrmClient --> CRM

Endpoints --> Audio
Endpoints --> DbSession

note bottom of Endpoints
Main conversation state is persisted in ChatMessage.metadata_json.
Pending actions are carried between turns via this metadata.
end note

@enduml

@startuml talk2api2_process_input_workflow
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam BackgroundColor #FAFAFA

title talk2api2 - Runtime Workflow (POST /process-input/)

actor Client
participant "API /process-input" as API
participant "get_tenant_context" as Ctx
participant "TenantManager" as TM
participant "DB\nChat/ChatMessage" as DB
participant "SugarClient" as CRM
participant "TenantRAGService" as RAG
participant "pending_patch" as Patch
participant "quick_actions" as QA
participant "run_agent" as Agent
participant "build_tools\ncrm_action/rag/my_meetings/crm_query" as Tools
participant "CRMWriteService\n(+ ModuleAdjustmentEngine)" as WriteSvc
participant "LLM" as LLM
participant "Audio (edge-tts)" as TTS

Client -> API: POST /process-input\ninput_text, chat_id?, context?, return_voice
API -> Ctx: resolve tenant/user + optional HMAC verify
Ctx -> TM: assert_user_access + get_credentials
TM --> Ctx: tenant ok + decrypted CRM creds
Ctx --> API: TenantContext

API -> CRM: init with tenant creds + user_id
API -> RAG: get or init singleton
API -> DB: load/create chat + load latest pending_action
API -> DB: append user message

alt pending_action exists AND not confirm_action AND input looks like edit
  API -> Patch: try_patch_pending_action(input_text, pending_action)
  Patch --> API: confirmation_required (patched pending_action)
  API -> API: execution_mode = pending_patch
else no pending patch
  alt quick action matched (create_contact/create_meeting)
    API -> QA: try_handle_quick_action(...)
    QA -> WriteSvc: execute_quick_command(...)
    WriteSvc --> QA: confirmation_required | ok | resolution_required
    QA --> API: quick result (or fallback)
    API -> API: execution_mode = quick_action
  else fallback to agent path
    API -> Tools: build_tools(...)
    API -> Agent: run_agent(input_text, context, tools)
    loop up to 6 iterations
      Agent -> LLM: prompt with tool instructions + date context
      LLM --> Agent: <tool_call>... or <answer>...
      alt tool call
        Agent -> Tools: invoke selected tool
        alt crm_action_tool
          Tools -> WriteSvc: execute_action(module, action, data_json)
          WriteSvc --> Tools: confirmation_required | crm error | success
        else crm_query/my_meetings/rag_search
          Tools -> CRM: list/get actions
          Tools -> RAG: semantic search (when requested)
        end
        Tools --> Agent: observation JSON
      else answer
        Agent -> Agent: finalize output
      end
    end
    Agent --> API: output + intermediate_steps
    API -> API: normalize result for UI/cards/pending_action
    API -> API: execution_mode = agent
  end
end

API -> DB: append assistant message\n(metadata.agent_result, raw_output)
API -> DB: load history + ensure chat name + commit

alt return_voice = true
  API -> TTS: background synthesize_to_file(assistant_text)
  TTS --> API: audio file id/url
end

API --> Client: BaseResponse(success=true, response={\nmessage_to_user, action_result, cards, chat_history, audio_url?})

note right of API
/process-audio uses Whisper transcription first,
then reuses the same _process_input_core flow.

/rag/ingest can run sync or background and pulls CRM data
through SugarClient into tenant-scoped Qdrant collection.
end note

@enduml
